message: "If you reference this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Hawkeye Sterling — Entity Risk Assessment (RA)"
abstract: >-
  A single-file web application for AML/CFT customer (entity) risk assessment,
  built as a template for Dealers in Precious Metals and Stones (DPMS) and
  adaptable to other reporting entities. Includes a deterministic on-device
  risk-scoring engine, an optional LLM-backed advisor, and automated
  regulatory, sanctions, and FATF watchdogs.
type: software
authors:
